The CRAP (Change Risk Anti-Patterns) score of the containing method is too high. 

Could we add a builder class to separate unit-agnostic options and unit-dependent options? 
```
class FullyShardOptionsBuilder:
  def __init__(self, unit_agnostic_options)
  def build(self, unit)
```
I'd also move it out of this class or even out of this file.

